Greetings, Hal Jordan.

255
00:14:10,933 --> 00:14:13,394
To access the vault,
please confirm identity.

256
00:14:13,435 --> 00:14:14,478
Ready.

257
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:16,355
Mogo doesn't socialize.

258
00:14:17,439 --> 00:14:18,858
