262
00:14:28,993 --> 00:14:30,828
(STRAINING)
It's a pocket dimension, Junior.

263
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:33,956
Just... just feel around
in there and...

264
00:14:33,956 --> 00:14:35,624
(GRUNTS) ...you'll find it.

265
00:14:35,666 --> 00:14:37,877
(BIRD CHIRPS)

266
00:14:37,918 --> 00:14:40,129
♪ (UNSETTLING MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

267
00:14:41,881 --> 00:14:44,133
