304
00:17:00,519 --> 00:17:01,645
Fucking Jordan.

305
00:17:02,146 --> 00:17:05,232
(TIRES SCREECHING)

306
00:17:18,454 --> 00:17:20,748
(HAL GRUNTS)

307
00:17:24,668 --> 00:17:25,711
(FEET THUDDING)

308
00:17:25,753 --> 00:17:27,755
(GRUNTING)

309
00:17:39,224 --> 00:17:41,101
(DETECTOR CHIRPS)

310
00:17:48,025 --> 00:17:49,318
(DETECTOR CHIRPS)

311
00:17:50,069 --> 00:17:53,155
-(PANTING)
-(SCANNER CHIRPS)

312
00:17:53,155 --> 00:17:55,324
