315
00:18:09,004 --> 00:18:11,006
(JOHN GASPS, GROANS)

316
00:18:11,006 --> 00:18:12,841
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

317
00:18:12,841 --> 00:18:14,343
(GROANS)

318
00:18:15,385 --> 00:18:16,678
(GROANS)

319
00:18:16,678 --> 00:18:18,388
(TASER CRACKLING)

320
00:18:18,430 --> 00:18:20,766
-(RUMBLING)
-♪ (MUSIC FADES) ♪

321
00:18:28,816 --> 00:18:30,526
(JOHN GRUNTS)

322
00:18:33,862 --> 00:18:35,864
(PANTS)

323
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:40,702
Where are we going?

324
00:18:42,913 --> 00:18:44,498
Where's my fucking bird?

325
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:46,250
Your bird's safe.

326
00:18:48,043 --> 00:18:49,378
(CHIRPS)

327
00:18:49,419 --> 00:18:51,672
-(ASSAILANT YELPS)
-♪ (INTENSE MUSIC RESUMES) ♪

328
00:18:51,713 --> 00:18:53,340
(TIRES SCREECHING)

329
00:18:55,717 --> 00:18:57,219
(ASSAILANT GROANS)

330
00:18:58,762 --> 00:19:00,389
♪ (MUSIC RISES) ♪

331
00:19:03,892 --> 00:19:06,895
-(GRUNTS)
-(ASSAILANT GROANS)

332
00:19:11,733 --> 00:19:13,277
(BOTH GRUNTING)

333
00:19:13,735 --> 00:19:15,112
(GROANS)

334
00:19:16,238 --> 00:19:19,116
(JOHN GROANING)

335
00:19:20,075 --> 00:19:21,577
(BIRD CHIRPING)

336
00:19:21,618 --> 00:19:22,578
